      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So after a year+ of dealing with this annoying problem and vigorously testing every solution I could come across, I finally caved and upgraded my motherboard from an Asrock x670e PG Lightning to an MSI x870 Tomahawk and can confirm I no longer have the jitter issue. I guess throwing money at the problem fixes stuff, but oof. bigsadge.",
