      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just realized that I haven't encountered this issue for a long time, so I am not even sure when exactly it stopped doing it.\n\nDon't know if VRC did some update or I updated something in my PC.\n\nOther possibility of why it may got fixed is the new 2.5GbE network switch my PC is connected to that replaced previous 1GbE switch around the time when I stopped noticing the issue.",
